{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 10, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "召", "id": "召"}, {"form": "庶人", "id": "庶人"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "招", "id": "招"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "禦", "id": "禦"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "庶人", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "庶人", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "庶人", "target": "往"}, {"weight": 2.344549292093078, "source": "往", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 3.4431615807611875, "source": "往", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 1.9390841839849136, "source": "往", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 2.1903986122658194, "source": "往", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "往", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "往", "target": "招"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "至", "target": "力"}, {"weight": 2.750014400201242, "source": "至", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "聞", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "聞", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "今", "target": "禦"}, {"weight": 2.6164830075767194, "source": "今", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.6164830075767194, "source": "今", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "禦", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "sourc